  "guideText": {
    "source": "请求以 JSON 发送。配置 Secret 可校验签名，接收端需在指定超时时间内响应。",
    "translations": {
      "en": {"text":"Requests are sent as JSON. Configure a secret to verify signatures and respond within the selected timeout.","sourceRevision":"d78e2d3e815d23fc89cf87482127ebeff4624f90d21bfadec442a1862365fa46","reviewed":true},
      "ja": {"text":"リクエストはJSON形式で送信します。署名の検証に使う秘密鍵を設定し、指定した制限時間内に応答してください。","sourceRevision":"d78e2d3e815d23fc89cf87482127ebeff4624f90d21bfadec442a1862365fa46","reviewed":true},
      "it": {"text":"Le richieste sono inviate in formato JSON. Imposta una chiave segreta per verificare le firme e rispondi entro il tempo massimo configurato.","sourceRevision":"d78e2d3e815d23fc89cf87482127ebeff4624f90d21bfadec442a1862365fa46","reviewed":true},
      "ru": {"text":"Запросы отправляются в формате JSON. Настройте секрет для проверки подписей и отвечайте в пределах выбранного таймаута.","sourceRevision":"d78e2d3e815d23fc89cf87482127ebeff4624f90d21bfadec442a1862365fa46","reviewed":true},
      "ko": {"text":"요청은 JSON으로 전송됩니다. 서명을 확인할 비밀 키를 설정하고 지정한 제한 시간 안에 응답하세요.","sourceRevision":"d78e2d3e815d23fc89cf87482127ebeff4624f90d21bfadec442a1862365fa46","reviewed":true},
      "fr": {"text":"Les requêtes sont envoyées en JSON. Définissez une clé secrète pour vérifier les signatures et répondez dans le délai indiqué.","sourceRevision":"d78e2d3e815d23fc89cf87482127ebeff4624f90d21bfadec442a1862365fa46","reviewed":true}
    }
  },
